{"title": "Weatherization Assistance Program Timeline", "link": "https://www.energy.gov/cmei/scep/wap/weatherization-assistance-program-timeline", "summary": "<span class=\"field field--string field--title\">Weatherization Assistance Program Timeline</span>\n\n<span class=\"field field--author field--uid\" rel=\"schema:author\"><span lang=\"lang\">monica.arevalo…</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"field field--timestamp field--created\"><time datetime=\"2019-08-06T13:36:23-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, August 6, 2019 - 13:36\">August 6, 2019</time>\n</span>\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n<section class=\"layout blade-section--boxed\">\n\n    <div class=\"grid-container\">\n      <div class=\"blade-color blade-section--white\">\n                                      <div class=\"grid-row\">\n                  <div class=\"grid-col\">\n      \n\n<div class=\"block block-layout-builder block-inline-blockbasic\">\n        \n    \n          \n\n            <div class=\"field field--text_default field--body field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Read history and background on the U.S. Department of Energy's (DOE) Weatherization Assistance Program (WAP).</p></div>\n      \n            </div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"block block-layout-builder block-inline-blockmedia\">\n            \n            \n                                      \n\n            <div class=\"field field--entity_reference_entity_view field--field_media field field--name-field-media field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">\n<div>\n  \n<div class=\"timeline\" id=\"timeline-embed--232274\"></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n      \n                    \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n        </div>\n            </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>", "published": "2019-08-06T08:36:23+00:00", "source": "DOE Energy News", "category": "refund", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-05-13T11:35:03.279988+00:00"}
{"title": "Savannah River Site History 1990-Present", "link": "https://www.energy.gov/srs/savannah-river-site-history-1990-present", "summary": "<span class=\"field field--string field--title\">Savannah River Site History 1990-Present</span>\n\n<span class=\"field field--author field--uid\" rel=\"schema:author\"><span lang=\"lang\">cameron.brazie…</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"field field--timestamp field--created\"><time datetime=\"2019-03-05T13:01:20-05:00\" title=\"Tuesday, March 5, 2019 - 13:01\">March 5, 2019</time>\n</span>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"layout blade-section--boxed\">\n\n    <div class=\"grid-container\">\n      <div class=\"blade-color \">\n                                      <div class=\"grid-row\">\n                  <div class=\"grid-col\">\n      \n\n<div class=\"block block-layout-builder block-inline-blockbasic\">\n        \n    \n          \n\n            <div class=\"field field--text_default field--body field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>The Savannah River Site was constructed during the early 1950s to produce the basic materials used in the fabrication of nuclear weapons, primarily tritium and plutonium-239, in support of our nation's defense programs. Five reactors were built to produce these materials. Also built were a number of support facilities including two chemical separations plants, a heavy water extraction plant, a nuclear fuel and target fabrication facility, a tritium extraction facility and waste management facilities.</p></div>\n      \n            </div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"block block-layout-builder block-inline-blockmedia\">\n            \n            \n                                      \n\n            <div class=\"field field--entity_reference_entity_view field--field_media field field--name-field-media field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">\n<div>\n  \n<div class=\"timeline\" id=\"timeline-embed--232266\"></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n      \n                    \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n        </div>\n            </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>", "published": "2019-03-05T09:01:20+00:00", "source": "DOE Energy News", "category": "refund", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-05-13T11:35:03.279988+00:00"}
{"title": "Savannah River Site History 1950-1989", "link": "https://www.energy.gov/srs/savannah-river-site-history-1950-1989", "summary": "<span class=\"field field--string field--title\">Savannah River Site History 1950-1989</span>\n\n<span class=\"field field--author field--uid\" rel=\"schema:author\"><span lang=\"lang\">maura.long@hq…</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"field field--timestamp field--created\"><time datetime=\"2018-11-09T14:15:02-05:00\" title=\"Friday, November 9, 2018 - 14:15\">November 9, 2018</time>\n</span>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"layout blade-section--boxed\">\n\n    <div class=\"grid-container\">\n      <div class=\"blade-color \">\n                                      <div class=\"grid-row\">\n                  <div class=\"grid-col\">\n      \n\n<div class=\"block block-layout-builder block-inline-blockbasic\">\n        \n    \n          \n\n            <div class=\"field field--text_default field--body field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>The Savannah River Site was constructed during the early 1950s to produce the basic materials used in the fabrication of nuclear weapons, primarily tritium and plutonium-239, in support of our nation's defense programs. Five reactors were built to produce these materials. Also built were a number of support facilities including two chemical separations plants, a heavy water extraction plant, a nuclear fuel and target fabrication facility, a tritium extraction facility and waste management facilities.</p></div>\n      \n            </div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"block block-layout-builder block-inline-blockmedia\">\n            \n            \n                                      \n\n            <div class=\"field field--entity_reference_entity_view field--field_media field field--name-field-media field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">\n<div>\n  \n<div class=\"timeline\" id=\"timeline-embed--232270\"></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n  